  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Trap. When Dust Trap is triggered, every second (for 5 seconds total), all nearby foes are Blinded for 3...7...8 seconds and take 10...22...25 damage. While activating this skill, you are easily interrupted. Dust Trap ends after 90 seconds.",
      "zhTW": "當塵土陷阱被觸動時，使陷阱附近的所有敵人每秒受到 10～25 土系傷害(最多5秒)，並且使他們遭受「盲目」病症 3～8 秒。此技能施展時容易被中斷。塵土陷阱在 90 秒後消失。"
    },
